  "description": "Whether you're cruising through the city or enjoying the freedom of a tour outside of town, the Appia adapts perfectly to your pace. The Appia is part of the E-Trekking model series and impresses with a comfortable, sturdy aluminum frame, specifically designed for the powerful Pinion Gearbox.Unit drive. Together with the maintenance-free Gates Carbon Belt Drive, it guarantees a worry-free riding experience. With its relaxed yet agile geometry, you'll maintain control at all times, while the soft suspension fork smooths out bumpy roads. The best part: you can customize the Appia to suit your needs – for example, with a range extender for even longer rides. This way, you can not only master your daily exploration rides but also fine-tune it for any adventure. The Appia – for every goal you set and every adventure you want to experience.",
